		<dct:bibliographicCitation>[7] R. Ruiz-Dolz, J. Lawrence, E. Schad, and C. Reed, “Overview of DialAM-2024: Argument mining in natural language dialogues,” in Proc. 11th Workshop on Argument Mining (ArgMining 2024), Bangkok, Thailand, 2024, pp. 83–92, doi: 10.18653/v1/2024.argmining-1.8.</dct:bibliographicCitation>
